<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: TABLE - Heiton year profits rise 25 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Heiton year profits rise 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 30</p>
<p>			  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		12.33		  vs 9.84</p>
<p> Final dividend (pence) 2.25		   vs 2.15</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 3.9		    vs 3.1</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    8.61		   vs 6.90</p>
<p> Turnover		   140.4		  vs 128.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Heiton Holdings is an Irish-based building materials group.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom + 353 1 676 9775</p>
</text>
